Module: lightning.guest_vulkan.mesa_d3d10_gallium
Purpose: Zink changes the Direct3D UMD needs in the pinned Mesa 26.0.8.
Created: 2026-10-16
Architecture: Applied to the pinned d3d10 Mesa tree by build_windows_icd.rs after it
overlays the owned frontend from lightning/direct3d-umd. Shared and scanout images,
deferred fences, resource rebinding, D3D vertex IDs for TGSI shaders Zink
translates itself, and the threaded-submit wakeup a map after an async flush waits
for (zink_submit_wakeup_acceptance.c). The UMD hands Zink NIR (ShaderNIR.c), so
tgsi_to_nir is unchanged.

